       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-LASER-ULTRA.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-LASER-ULTRA-PROOFS.
           05  WS-BROADBAND-LAUNCH-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-FABRY-PEROT-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ELASTIC-TENSOR-OK        PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LU-LATENCY-OK            PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LU-SEAL-OK               PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-LASER-ULTRA-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PLU-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PLU-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-LAUNCH-AND-FABRY.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-TENSOR-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PLU-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-LAUNCH-AND-FABRY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-BROADBAND-LAUNCH-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FABRY-PEROT-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-TENSOR-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ELASTIC-TENSOR-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LU-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PLU-PROOFS.
           IF WS-BROADBAND-LAUNCH-OK = 1 AND
              WS-FABRY-PEROT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-ELASTIC-TENSOR-OK = 1 AND
              WS-LU-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-LU-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PLU-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PLU-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PLU-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PLU-CODE.
